{"kind": "daily", "period": "2026-10-12", "prepared_on": "2026-10-12", "html": "<div style=\"font-family:-apple-system,'PingFang TC','Helvetica Neue',Arial,sans-serif;max-width:680px;margin:0 auto;color:#16213e;\">\n<div style=\"font-size:20px;font-weight:800;color:#1a2b4a;border-left:5px solid #5b8def;padding-left:12px;margin:0 0 18px;\">📰 每日 AI 新聞 Top 10 · 2026-10-12</div>\n\n<div style=\"background:#fdeef0;border-left:5px solid #e0738a;border-radius:10px;padding:13px 16px;margin-bottom:11px;\">\n  <div style=\"font-size:15px;font-weight:800;color:#16213e;line-height:1.4;\"><span style=\"color:#e0738a;font-weight:800;\">1.</span> Chinese security firm Integrity Tech backed Flax Typhoon hackers, CISA says<span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#fff;color:#d83a5e;font-size:11px;font-weight:700;padding:1px 8px;border-radius:20px;margin-left:5px;\">資安</span></div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:13px;color:#5b6470;margin:3px 0 6px;\">CISA揭露中國資安公司支援駭客攻擊，竊取多國組織敏感資料</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#555c68;line-height:1.55;\">On Oct 8, US agencies and partners from six other countries said Integrity Technology Group supplied attack tools and infrastructure, and its staff directly took part in intrusions supporting Chinese hackers.</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#8a909c;margin-top:3px;line-height:1.55;\">10月8日美國與英、澳、加、日、紐、西等國機關聯合公告，指永信至誠科技不僅提供攻擊工具與基礎設施，員工也直接參與入侵，支援中國駭客的攻擊行動。</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12px;margin-top:7px;\"><b style=\"color:#3b424f;\">iThome</b> · <a href=\"https://www.ithome.com.tw/news/179560\" style=\"color:#3b6cf6;text-decoration:none;\">原文連結</a></div>\n</div>\n\n<div style=\"background:#edeefb;border-left:5px solid #6b72d6;border-radius:10px;padding:13px 16px;margin-bottom:11px;\">\n  <div style=\"font-size:15px;font-weight:800;color:#16213e;line-height:1.4;\"><span style=\"color:#6b72d6;font-weight:800;\">2.</span> Satya Nadella says we should assume all AI models are \"compromised\"<span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#fff;color:#5159c9;font-size:11px;font-weight:700;padding:1px 8px;border-radius:20px;margin-left:5px;\">政策</span></div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:13px;color:#5b6470;margin:3px 0 6px;\">納德拉：應假設所有 AI 模型都已被「入侵」</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#555c68;line-height:1.55;\">In a long post on X, Microsoft's CEO laid out the dangers of highly advanced AI models and how to confront them. He says AI can no longer be treated as \"nested black boxes\" whose advice and actions we simply accept.</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#8a909c;margin-top:3px;line-height:1.55;\">微軟執行長在 X 上發表長文，闡述先進 AI 模型的風險與因應之道，強調不能再把 AI 當成「層層黑盒」而照單全收其建議與行動。</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12px;margin-top:7px;\"><b style=\"color:#3b424f;\">The Verge</b> · <a href=\"https://www.theverge.com/ai-artificial-intelligence/1009337/satya-nadella-says-we-should-assume-all-ai-models-are-compromised\" style=\"color:#3b6cf6;text-decoration:none;\">原文連結</a></div>\n</div>\n\n<div style=\"background:#e8f4fb;border-left:5px solid #3f97c9;border-radius:10px;padding:13px 16px;margin-bottom:11px;\">\n  <div style=\"font-size:15px;font-weight:800;color:#16213e;line-height:1.4;\"><span style=\"color:#3f97c9;font-weight:800;\">3.</span> JetBrains open-sources Mellum 2.1, lifting code-repair benchmark resolve rate from 2% to 47%<span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#fff;color:#2b7fb0;font-size:11px;font-weight:700;padding:1px 8px;border-radius:20px;margin-left:5px;\">模型</span></div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:13px;color:#5b6470;margin:3px 0 6px;\">JetBrains開源Mellum2.1模型，程式修復評測解決率從2%升至47%</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#555c68;line-height:1.55;\">The open model targets coding agents and can run on a developer's machine or company servers. Reinforcement learning drives the gains, and it is on Hugging Face under Apache 2.0.</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#8a909c;margin-top:3px;line-height:1.55;\">此開源模型鎖定程式開發代理，可部署在自己的電腦或企業伺服器，主要靠強化學習提升能力，已在 Hugging Face 以 Apache 2.0 授權釋出。</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12px;margin-top:7px;\"><b style=\"color:#3b424f;\">iThome</b> · <a href=\"https://www.ithome.com.tw/news/179561\" style=\"color:#3b6cf6;text-decoration:none;\">原文連結</a></div>\n</div>\n\n<div style=\"background:#f2f6e8;border-left:5px solid #88a83f;border-radius:10px;padding:13px 16px;margin-bottom:11px;\">\n  <div style=\"font-size:15px;font-weight:800;color:#16213e;line-height:1.4;\"><span style=\"color:#88a83f;font-weight:800;\">4.</span> Carbonato botnet hijacks Docker hosts and deploys AI agents to steal credentials<span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#fff;color:#6e8c28;font-size:11px;font-weight:700;padding:1px 8px;border-radius:20px;margin-left:5px;\">資安</span></div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:13px;color:#5b6470;margin:3px 0 6px;\">Carbonato殭屍網路入侵Docker主機，部署AI代理竊取憑證</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#555c68;line-height:1.55;\">Singapore's CSA warns the botnet exploits exposed Docker remote management interfaces. Attackers also plant AI agents on victim hosts to help steal credentials and other sensitive data.</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#8a909c;margin-top:3px;line-height:1.55;\">新加坡網路安全局警告，該殭屍網路利用未受保護的 Docker 遠端管理介面入侵，並在受害主機部署 AI 代理協助竊取憑證與敏感資訊。</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12px;margin-top:7px;\"><b style=\"color:#3b424f;\">iThome</b> · <a href=\"https://www.ithome.com.tw/news/179550\" style=\"color:#3b6cf6;text-decoration:none;\">原文連結</a></div>\n</div>\n\n<div style=\"background:#f9edf6;border-left:5px solid #c56bb0;border-radius:10px;padding:13px 16px;margin-bottom:11px;\">\n  <div style=\"font-size:15px;font-weight:800;color:#16213e;line-height:1.4;\"><span style=\"color:#c56bb0;font-weight:800;\">5.</span> Apple hires Huxe team, founded by ex-NotebookLM staff, and licenses its technology<span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#fff;color:#b04b9b;font-size:11px;font-weight:700;padding:1px 8px;border-radius:20px;margin-left:5px;\">產業</span></div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:13px;color:#5b6470;margin:3px 0 6px;\">蘋果招募由NotebookLM前員工合組的AI podcast App公司Huxe</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#555c68;line-height:1.55;\">An EU filing shows Apple made a hiring proposal to Huxe AI in June, taking on key employees and a non-exclusive license to its IP. Huxe builds a mobile app for personalized audio content.</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#8a909c;margin-top:3px;line-height:1.55;\">歐盟申報清單顯示，蘋果6月向 Huxe AI 提出招募提案，延攬核心成員並取得其智財的非獨家授權；Huxe 開發個人化音訊內容的手機 App。</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12px;margin-top:7px;\"><b style=\"color:#3b424f;\">iThome</b> · <a href=\"https://www.ithome.com.tw/news/179564\" style=\"color:#3b6cf6;text-decoration:none;\">原文連結</a></div>\n</div>\n\n<div style=\"background:#eef4ff;border-left:5px solid #5b8def;border-radius:10px;padding:13px 16px;margin-bottom:11px;\">\n  <div style=\"font-size:15px;font-weight:800;color:#16213e;line-height:1.4;\"><span style=\"color:#5b8def;font-weight:800;\">6.</span> Q3 global PC shipments fall more than 20%, the steepest drop in 3.5 years<span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#fff;color:#3b6cf6;font-size:11px;font-weight:700;padding:1px 8px;border-radius:20px;margin-left:5px;\">產業</span></div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:13px;color:#5b6470;margin:3px 0 6px;\">第三季全球PC出貨量衰退逾兩成，創3年半最大跌幅</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#555c68;line-height:1.55;\">IDC and Omdia both report global PC shipments down over 20% year on year in Q3 2026. Omdia says it is the biggest decline since Q1 2023.</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#8a909c;margin-top:3px;line-height:1.55;\">IDC 與 Omdia 皆指2026年第三季全球PC出貨量年減逾兩成，Omdia 表示為2023年第一季以來最大跌幅。</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12px;margin-top:7px;\"><b style=\"color:#3b424f;\">iThome</b> · <a href=\"https://www.ithome.com.tw/news/179568\" style=\"color:#3b6cf6;text-decoration:none;\">原文連結</a></div>\n</div>\n\n<div style=\"background:#ecf7ef;border-left:5px solid #4caf72;border-radius:10px;padding:13px 16px;margin-bottom:11px;\">\n  <div style=\"font-size:15px;font-weight:800;color:#16213e;line-height:1.4;\"><span style=\"color:#4caf72;font-weight:800;\">7.</span> Tesla renames FSD \"Tesla Assisted Driving\" in Europe to push for EU approval<span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#fff;color:#1e9e57;font-size:11px;font-weight:700;padding:1px 8px;border-radius:20px;margin-left:5px;\">產品</span></div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:13px;color:#5b6470;margin:3px 0 6px;\">特斯拉在歐洲將FSD改名為Tesla Assisted Driving，以推動歐盟核准</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#555c68;line-height:1.55;\">Tesla has renamed its Full Self-Driving driver-assistance system for the European market, and its German website already uses the new name.</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#8a909c;margin-top:3px;line-height:1.55;\">特斯拉近日將歐洲市場的 FSD 駕駛輔助系統更名為「特斯拉輔助駕駛」，德國官網已採用新名稱。</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12px;margin-top:7px;\"><b style=\"color:#3b424f;\">iThome</b> · <a href=\"https://www.ithome.com.tw/news/179577\" style=\"color:#3b6cf6;text-decoration:none;\">原文連結</a></div>\n</div>\n\n<div style=\"background:#f1ecfb;border-left:5px solid #8a6bd8;border-radius:10px;padding:13px 16px;margin-bottom:11px;\">\n  <div style=\"font-size:15px;font-weight:800;color:#16213e;line-height:1.4;\"><span style=\"color:#8a6bd8;font-weight:800;\">8.</span> Silicon Valley falls in line with Trump's push to rename AI \"super intelligence\"<span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#fff;color:#6b3bf6;font-size:11px;font-weight:700;padding:1px 8px;border-radius:20px;margin-left:5px;\">政策</span></div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:13px;color:#5b6470;margin:3px 0 6px;\">矽谷開始跟進川普把 AI 改名的做法</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#555c68;line-height:1.55;\">Most people still say AI, but some of Silicon Valley's most powerful figures are adopting the \"super intelligence\" rebrand announced by President Trump.</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#8a909c;margin-top:3px;line-height:1.55;\">多數人仍沿用「AI」一詞，但矽谷部分最具影響力的人物已開始採用川普宣布的「超級智慧」新稱呼。</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12px;margin-top:7px;\"><b style=\"color:#3b424f;\">The Verge</b> · <a href=\"https://www.theverge.com/ai-artificial-intelligence/1009406/silicon-valley-is-falling-in-line-with-trumps-attempt-to-rename-ai\" style=\"color:#3b6cf6;text-decoration:none;\">原文連結</a></div>\n</div>\n\n<div style=\"background:#e8f6f5;border-left:5px solid #2bb0a6;border-radius:10px;padding:13px 16px;margin-bottom:11px;\">\n  <div style=\"font-size:15px;font-weight:800;color:#16213e;line-height:1.4;\"><span style=\"color:#2bb0a6;font-weight:800;\">9.</span> How enterprises can stop AI agents from \"doing the wrong thing\": four governance directions<span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#fff;color:#0f9b9b;font-size:11px;font-weight:700;padding:1px 8px;border-radius:20px;margin-left:5px;\">資安</span></div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:13px;color:#5b6470;margin:3px 0 6px;\">企業如何防止AI代理「做錯事」，專家建議四大治理方向</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#555c68;line-height:1.55;\">Agentic AI tools that handle email, files and system commands are entering workplaces fast, opening new security gaps. Experts raise questions on agent permissions, IT visibility and response when an agent errs.</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#8a909c;margin-top:3px;line-height:1.55;\">能處理郵件、檔案與系統指令的代理式 AI 快速進入企業，也帶來新的資安破口；專家聚焦代理的權限範圍、IT 可視性，以及判斷失準時的因應。</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12px;margin-top:7px;\"><b style=\"color:#3b424f;\">iThome</b> · <a href=\"https://www.ithome.com.tw/news/179532\" style=\"color:#3b6cf6;text-decoration:none;\">原文連結</a></div>\n</div>\n\n<div style=\"background:#fbf3e3;border-left:5px solid #d99b3f;border-radius:10px;padding:13px 16px;margin-bottom:11px;\">\n  <div style=\"font-size:15px;font-weight:800;color:#16213e;line-height:1.4;\"><span style=\"color:#d99b3f;font-weight:800;\">10.</span> AI is getting really good at messing with cybercriminals<span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#fff;color:#b9791f;font-size:11px;font-weight:700;padding:1px 8px;border-radius:20px;margin-left:5px;\">研究</span></div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:13px;color:#5b6470;margin:3px 0 6px;\">AI 越來越擅長戲弄網路罪犯</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#555c68;line-height:1.55;\">Anti-cybercrime initiatives increasingly use AI to scam the scammers, tricking them into talking with lifelike bots they believe are real victims.</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#8a909c;margin-top:3px;line-height:1.55;\">反網路犯罪行動越來越常用 AI 反過來「詐騙詐騙者」，讓對方與擬真機器人對話，誤以為是真正的受害者。</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12px;margin-top:7px;\"><b style=\"color:#3b424f;\">Wired</b> · <a href=\"https://www.wired.com/story/ai-is-getting-really-good-at-messing-with-cybercriminals/\" style=\"color:#3b6cf6;text-decoration:none;\">原文連結</a></div>\n</div>\n\n<div style=\"text-align:center;font-size:11.5px;color:#9aa1ad;padding-top:10px;\">由 AI News Digest 從各家 RSS 自動挑選、翻譯並寄送</div>\n</div>\n"}